Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||05-03-2000||11:39 PM||||Talk to DXR_DAD, he has carbon fiber vinyl in his SE, up close you can tell it's not real (he sent me a sample) but it looks really good.. and it's a fraction of the cost of real CF.<P>There are several places selling real carbon fiber dash kits however, Dennis LaGrua, Mr. Mikes, and I think a place called AutoDash.. I'll need to get the links for that. They're all on my fiero website, but I'm not sure if that's back up on the new server yet.. Other people on the forum will have those links for you. I also have an article up about other panels/parts made from carbon fiber.. the car is an ugly Datsun 510, but the article is pretty cool.. the guy made door panels, a new dash, intercooler housings/ducts.. fun stuff.||||reg||1
